ection for AI infrastructure and we are very bullish about this.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/30/check-point-chkp-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"CHKP 2026 Q2","e":"chkp","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Roei Golan","x":"The increase -- the net increase is primarily as a result of increase in our workforce and as a result in continuing investment in AI security and investment in our sales and marketing programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/check-point-chkp-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHKP 2026 Q2","e":"chkp","d":"2026-07-30","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Todd Weller","x":"There's AI application and infrastructure deployments related to that AI data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/check-point-chkp-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHKP 2026 Q2","e":"chkp","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Nadav Zafrir","x":"We expect Q3 to mark the trough, followed by a stronger Q4 that supports second half performance, and we are maintaining our 2026 guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/check-point-chkp-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHKP 2026 Q2","e":"chkp","d":"2026-07-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Nadav Zafrir","x":"And when we look at what's happening in the future in Q4, like Roei said, we're seeing a much better outcome, and that's why we are maintaining the guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/check-point-chkp-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"CHKP 2026 Q3","e":"chkp","d":"2026-11-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Nadav Zafrir","x":"Just a few days ago, we introduced our next-generation Maestro Hyperscale Orchestrator, which is designed to support neoclouds, telcos, and government, as well as large enterprise, to inspect AI traffic in the data center without compromising secur